## Overview

AWS Auto Scaling allows you to dynamically adjust the number of Amazon EC2 instances or ECS tasks in response to changing demand to maintain application performance and optimize costs. It automatically adds capacity during demand spikes and removes capacity during low-traffic periods.

### Key Benefits

✅ **High Availability:** Automatically replaces failed instances/tasks
✅ **Cost Optimization:** Scale down during low traffic periods
✅ **Performance:** Maintains desired performance levels during traffic spikes
✅ **Zero Downtime:** Gradual scaling without service interruption
✅ **Integration:** Works seamlessly with load balancers and monitoring tools

