## Summary

AWS Auto Scaling provides flexible options for managing capacity:

✅ **EC2 Auto Scaling:** For traditional server-based applications
✅ **ECS Auto Scaling:** For containerized microservices
✅ **Target Tracking:** Recommended for most workloads
✅ **Scheduled Scaling:** For predictable traffic patterns
✅ **Step Scaling:** For aggressive responses to metric changes

Proper configuration of Auto Scaling ensures your applications remain performant, highly available, and cost-efficient across varying load conditions.

